{
  "about": "Doctrines = CoH3 battlegroups (2026-11-28). A side picks one doctrine per match, in any own turn, free (recommended values): it unlocks the battlegroup's units (they join their tier building's production), its CoH3 upgrades (abilities and kits that require them) and the conversions to its units. `factions` is written by node tools/coh3/doctrines.js; `aliases` (conversions.json battlegroup names → CoH3 ids) and `assign` (doctrine units CoH3 names in no battlegroup → one, recommended) are hand-edited.",
